From a113c749b826ac7d0eaa6f80947ccd82ba35b11b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:02:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Make it real: Lighthouse with server Chrome (no quota), live
 check of published fixes in a real browser, snippet supports single-page
 sites + robust image matching, keyword push uses Search Console page and real
 page content, no invented keyword data, Search opportunities for small sites,
 Maps setup guide

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019MkVpnoyjaaakp7yQiE2ks
